     - **Suggestions:** Implement validation checks both on the client side (in the forms) and on the server side (in the Flask routes) to provide user feedback. For example, after submitting the registration or login form, confirm success or failure with an appropriate message displayed on the UI.

   - **Problem 3:** Lack of separation of concerns with combined user management and project functionality in the `App` class.
